"value":1,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5267890","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4450660-1844751498224892","game_id":"steam-4450660","kind":"announcement","title":"Flick Demo is LIVE!","summary":"After months of grinding, playtesting, and jumping from one bug to another, it's finally time to release...💀THE FLICK DEMO💀This demo consists of the first three rooms of the main game (minus a few key story elements) and generally takes between 15-20 minutes to complete. If you dig what you play here, tell your friends and don't forget to wishlist!A million and one thanks to everyone who playtested this experience and gave amazing feedback. Without you, we'd have a totally different game on our ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-25T15:10:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498224892","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:26:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4450660-1839041357030391","game_id":"steam-4450660","kind":"announcement","title":"Flick Discord Now Online","summary":"Hi everyone!After a ton of feedback, I thought it best to make a discord for Flick. This will help folks who playtest the game give solid feedback in an easy form that most folks are used to.I'll also use the discord server as a way to float ideas, invite members to private playtests (you didn't think this was the only playtest we'd be running, did you?), and send out exclusive updates.It'll also be a chill place to just come and chat about video games, game dev in general, and whatever else mig","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-24T18:22:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357030391","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:26:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4450660-1837955055356006","game_id":"steam-4450660","kind":"announcement","title":"Flick Playtest NOW LIVE","summary":"Finally!Wow. It's been a long time coming, but we finally made it! There have been some ups and some downs (as with all things game dev related), but the release of this playtest marks an important stepping stone in the lifetime of this game. A little about the playtest....I wanted to create a short experience that would really give players a good sense of the style of horror game that I'm going for. The keyword here being that it's SHORT. Like 15-20 minutes short (unless you enjoy poking your n","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-10T07:44:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055356006","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:26:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4450660":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:30:07Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:30:07Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4450660":"2026-10-26T12:30:07Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4450660":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:30:07Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:30:07Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:30:07Z"},"5267890":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:30:07Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:30:07Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:30:07Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4450660","app_id":4450660,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:37Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"c82338296b9f239b069dd19ed6616fca16c